{
  "category": "Dragon Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its wing-like pectoral fins and stout tail.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its wing-like pectoral fins and stout tail.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Touching the back fin causes numbness. It hooks its tail to coral to stay in place while sleeping.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "An examination of its cells revealed the presence of a gene not found in HORSEA. It became a hot topic.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fin-tips leak poison. Its fins and bones are highly valued as ingredients in herbal medicine.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The male raises the young. If it is approached, it uses its toxic spikes to fend off the intruder.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "SEADRA sleeps after wriggling itself between the branches of coral. Those trying to harvest coral are occasionally stung by this POKéMON’s poison barbs if they fail to notice it.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SEADRA generates whirlpools by spinning its body. The whirlpools are strong enough to swallow even fishing boats. This POKéMON weakens prey with these currents, then swallows it whole.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "The poisonous barbs all over its body are highly valued as ingredients for making traditional herbal medicine. It shows no mercy to anything approaching its nest.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body bristles with sharp spikes. Carelessly trying to touch it could cause fainting from the spikes.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its winglike pectoral fins and stout tail.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
